1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,500
Don't you waste a single minute crying at the gate

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:06,420
Every single thing I did was just to make you great

3
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:10,100
When the hard days come to find you, take them on the chin

4
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:14,500
Keep your circle small and tight, and let the good ones in

5
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:17,860
Show up for each other the way I showed for you

6
00:00:17,860 --> 00:00:21,000
Pull a chair up by the bed and stay the whole night through
